 "text": "There's a kind of tired that doesn't come from being lazy.\nIt comes from continuing when nothing seems to happen.\n\nYou're not imagining it.\nThe waiting is real.\nThe effort is real.\nAnd the silence \u2014 that's real too.\n\nBut waiting isn't the same as standing still.\nThe fact that you're still here, still going \u2014 that matters.\n\nPsalm 27 says: \"Wait for God. Be strong, and let your heart take courage.\"\nNot passive.\nJust strength in the quiet.\n\nYou don't need to see it to keep going.\nStart with today.\n\nShare this with someone who needs it.",
